meta {
  name: 04 Get Transaction
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/patient-portal/transactions/{{patientTransactionId}}
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{patientAccessToken}}
}

docs {
  One transaction's full detail for the detail modal, owner-checked: the payment's
  order must belong to one of the session person's patient records in the tenant,
  else `404 TRANSACTION_NOT_FOUND` (no info leak — a patient can never reach
  another patient's transaction by changing the id). `{{patientTransactionId}}` is
  captured by **List Transactions**.

  Requires a patient JWT (`{{patientAccessToken}}`).

  Response `data`:
  - `id`, `transactionId` — PaymentDetails id (unique transaction identifier)
  - `amount` — amount collected (rupees; shown in the modal heading)
  - `transactionType` / `transactionTypeLabel` — see **List Transactions**
  - `billOrderId` — internal order UUID this payment belongs to; the modal uses it
    to download that order's bill PDF (`GET /patient-portal/bills/:orderId/pdf`)
  - `order`:
    - `patientName`, `patientId` — patient UMID (PAT…), `—` when none
    - `appointmentAt` — ISO appointment date/time from the ORDER (null for
      non-appointment orders). NEVER the transaction timestamp.
    - `orderId` — user-facing order code
    - `billStatus` / `billStatusLabel`
    - `branchName`
  - `payment`:
    - `transactionId` — PaymentDetails id
    - `paidOn` — ISO actual payment date/time
    - `amount` — amount received (rupees)
    - `paidVia` — payment-method label (Cash / UPI / Debit Card / …)
    - `refundDate` — ISO date of the order's latest refund, or `null` when none
}
